        "cooked": "<p>So, someone already lost one of my presence tokens.&nbsp;![](upload://cMxHQaDq0kbGxwGJQa30HupNF6d.gif)</p><p>I was able to find <a href=\"https://www.thegamecrafter.com/parts?q=&amp;hPP=25&amp;idx=products&amp;p=0&amp;dFR%5Bcategory%5D%5B0%5D=Tokens&amp;dFR%5Bmaterial%5D%5B0%5D=Wood&amp;dFR%5Bsize_in_mm%5D%5B0%5D=15&amp;fR%5Bcontains_gore%5D=0&amp;fR%5Bcontains_nudity%5D=0&amp;fR%5Bcontains_profanity%5D=0&amp;fR%5Bcontains_sexuality%5D=0&amp;fR%5Bcontains_substance_abuse%5D=0&amp;fR%5Bdepartment%5D%5B0%5D=parts&amp;utm_source=google&amp;utm_medium=adwords&amp;utm_campaign=game_pieces&amp;gclid=Cj0KCQiAnuDTBRDUARIsAL41eDogC1T8f2NXnU9Cy_spkFQSCh_hWoV1Elsk8TdRh0B3182NM5uu70YaApdHEALw_wcB&amp;is_v=1\">a close match at Gamecrafters</a> -- they're a little thicker and slightly higher diameter, but they work well enough and are fairly inexpensive. Plus it let me pick up other colors I didn't have!&nbsp;![](upload://ka7R8OGETnk0jL0K8DcghjoOdoJ.gif)</p><p>Wanted to both point out this resource and see if anyone has found other sources that are a closer match?&nbsp;</p>",
