        "created_at": "2018-02-16T19:57:13.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Paul\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/48/5862_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Paul:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>If you email&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:contact@greaterthangames.com\">contact@greaterthangames.com</a>, Craig can likely help you out with replacement parts <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p><span>Thanks, Paul!&nbsp;</span> <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/grin.png?v=12\" title=\":grin:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":grin:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"jffdougan\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jffdougan/48/1882_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> jffdougan:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.printplaygames.com/product/15mm-wood-discsSlightly\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://www.printplaygames.com/product/15mm-wood-discsSlightly</a> thicker than the ones that come with the game, and these:<a href=\"https://www.printplaygames.com/product/19mm-x-6mm-wood-discswere\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://www.printplaygames.com/product/19mm-x-6mm-wood-discswere</a> used for the reminder tokens.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Ooo… LOTS of color possibilities!&nbsp; <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/open_mouth.png?v=12\" title=\":open_mouth:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":open_mouth:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I love some of the custom presence folks have posted on BGG, but that's a bit more work than I want to put into it!&nbsp; <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slightly_smiling_face.png?v=12\" title=\":slightly_smiling_face:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slightly_smiling_face:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
